<title>BELGIUM: Belgian net debt totalled 9,769 bln bfr in April.</title>
<headline>Belgian net debt totalled 9,769 bln bfr in April.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury released the following data on the state's debt - (in bln francs)</p>
<p>    STATE DEBT	     end-April change in mth  change in 1997</p>
<p>Long-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     7,000.8   +15.7		 +2.0</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies   684.7    +2.8		+26.1</p>
<p>Short-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     1,873.9  -110.1	     + 83.6</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies    80.8    +3.1		+ 5.4</p>
<p>    net debt		 9,768.9   -33.6	     +240.4</p>
<p>    net borrowing requirement	 39.4		203.7</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
